{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16209730","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16209730","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1620973001:1":{"text":"原来还发生过这样的事吗？我之前完全没有听说过，也没有留下任何痕迹……","source_cn":"原来还发生过这样的事吗？我之前完全没有听说过，也没有留...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9E7580BB18DBC10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1620973001":{"text":"原来还发生过这样的事吗？我之前完全没有听说过，也没有留下任何痕迹……","source_cn":"原来还发生过这样的事吗？我之前完全没有听说过，也没有留下任何痕迹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9E7580BB18DBC10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620973002:1":{"text":"真的什么都没有留下吗？我不这样认为哦。","source_cn":"真的什么都没有留下吗？我不这样认为哦。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6CF7053CC88DE1E8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"真的什么都没有留下吗？我不这样认为哦。","female":"真的什么都没有留下吗？我不这样认为哦。","variant_male_record_index":"218193","variant_female_record_index":"218194","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620973003:1":{"text":"在那之前，<u><link=Case><style=\"highlight\">这里可没法像今天这样自由自在地开着茶会</style></link></u>。不会有随意讨论说笑的学生们，我们也无法随意挑选一个温暖的午后，尽情享受阳光与花朵。","source_cn":"在那之前，这里可没法像今天这样自由自在地开着茶会。不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63FA4AF6CF4240F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620973004:1":{"text":"此外，经过井喷式的创作、百般讨论的筛选，最终也留下了几种固定搭配的美味配方。它们被记载、被改良，成为了如今我们常喝的这几种花草茶。","source_cn":"此外，经过井喷式的创作、百般讨论的筛选，最终也留下了几...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x598918C228A5B512","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620973005:1":{"text":"甚至有学生的创造得到认可后，找到了自己真正的爱好与志向，决定不当魔法师，专门去研发茶饮。","source_cn":"甚至有学生的创造得到认可后，找到了自己真正的爱好与志向...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA2D3AB98D79F801","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620973006:1":{"text":"在我的印象里，那位同学最终得到了秘银商会的投资，真的开了一家饮品店，大受欢迎呢。","source_cn":"在我的印象里，那位同学最终得到了秘银商会的投资，真的开...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0495EA5265869509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620973007:1":{"text":"大多数人都忘记了这场事件。你为什么会知道，并将它记住？","source_cn":"大多数人都忘记了这场事件。你为什么会知道，并将它记住？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA128D841BB54C20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620973008:1":{"text":"因为这场花草茶事件，正是我加入莱希拉姆的原因呀。","source_cn":"因为这场花草茶事件，正是我加入莱希拉姆的原因呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC0E8118E22C459C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620973009:1":{"text":"欸？我有点不明白……","source_cn":"欸？我有点不明白……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7A637823BCD905C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620973010:1":{"text":"正是因为这场事件，才引发了学生们对草药学的热情与关注。","source_cn":"正是因为这场事件，才引发了学生们对草药学的热情与关注。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC584B47E08BFEB5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620973011:1":{"text":"第二年报课的人数比前一年整整翻了一番，教学人力不足，校方才决定启动招聘。","source_cn":"第二年报课的人数比前一年整整翻了一番，教学人力不足，校...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x813B04214B9F01C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620973012:1":{"text":"而且，同学们还特意强调：希望新来的老师，能有着包容质疑、鼓励创新的教学风格。","source_cn":"而且，同学们还特意强调：希望新来的老师，能有着包容质疑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC66FB920BFBC0F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620973013:1":{"text":"所以我才来到了这里，才能像现在这样，和大家一起开开心心地学习交流哦。","source_cn":"所以我才来到了这里，才能像现在这样，和大家一起开开心心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AE2A95E2B9EF49D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620973014:1":{"text":"原来是这样……","source_cn":"原来是这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3B3DA1CE69B2CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_rec